---
description: Frontend conventions for the Telegram Mini App
globs:
  - "miniapp/**"
alwaysApply: false
---
- Mobile-first Telegram WebView. Use `@tma.js/sdk-react` (see ADR-001). Respect viewport CSS variables, theme, safe areas, and the Telegram back button. Do not add MUI.
- Prefer native browser APIs and existing dependencies. Add packages only for a concrete requirement.
- Use TanStack Query for server state; add Zustand only for genuinely shared client state.
- Request camera/location permissions only after a clear user action.
- Clean up camera streams, event listeners, timers, and geolocation watches on unmount.
- Lazy-load heavy map/3D code and assets; provide a usable map/list fallback.
- Keep UI responsive on mid-range phones; avoid unnecessary re-renders and network requests.
